", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [251.713623046875, 62.767269134521484], "pos": [2364.754150390625, 1840.3624267578125], "id": 39, "properties": {"previousName": "prompt", "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [103], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "COMBO", "links": [], "label": "COMBO", "type": "*", "localized_name": "COMBO"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["Next Scene:主体为身着华美汉服、头戴金红珠翠发冠的女子（昭君），立于风雪中，目光望向远方匈奴方向，神情略带惆怅与坚毅；场景是漫天飞雪的塞外荒原，远处山峦覆雪朦胧；运动为头部微转、目光远眺，镜头慢推；美学控制是中景、侧光+雪景柔光、冷调高对比，呈现汉服刺绣与发冠金饰的精致，景别中景。\n\nNext Scene:主体为昭君，轻抚腰间玉佩，指尖冰凉，雪花落在手背随即融化；场景是雪地中的驿站旁，残破的旌旗在风雪中飘摇；运动为手部轻触玉佩、指尖微动，镜头特写；美学控制是近景、特写镜头、细腻光影，突出玉佩纹理与雪花动态，景别特写。\n\nNext Scene:主体为昭君，骑于马上，红袍在风雪中翻飞，发冠流苏随马步轻晃；场景是风雪交加的塞外古道，马蹄踏碎薄冰，远处有匈奴使者队伍的模糊轮廓；运动为骑马缓行、袍摆飞扬，镜头跟拍；美学控制是中景、跟拍镜头、电影感构图，呈现人物与环境的动态交融，景别中景。\n\nNext Scene:主体为昭君，立于营帐前，望着帐内匈奴单于送来的暖裘，神情复杂；场景是匈奴营地，帐外风雪呼啸，帐内灯火隐约；运动为身体微侧、目光扫过暖裘，镜头侧移；美学控制是中近景、侧移镜头、冷暖光影对比，突出人物内心的挣扎与环境的孤寂，景别中近景。\n\nNext Scene:主体为昭君，在匈奴宫廷中，身着融合汉匈风格的服饰，手持胡笳，目光平和望向殿外飞雪；场景是匈奴宫殿，内饰带有游牧民族特色，殿外雪花纷飞；运动为手持胡笳、姿态优雅，镜头环绕；美学控制是中景、环绕镜头、写实风格，呈现文化融合的细节与人物的从容，景别中景。", 0, 1000, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 102, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "label": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "起始索引"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "label": "max_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "最大行数"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [269.7790222167969, 455.7739562988281], "pos": [2358.5888671875, 1947.16455078125], "id": 16, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "11794f7d718dc38dded09e677817add796ce0234", "widget_ue_connectable": {"start_index": true, "max_rows": true, "prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptLine"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [473.202880859375, 179.82406616210938], "pos": [1867.99560546875, 2208.71484375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 104, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 48, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [102, 104], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [469.54083251953125, 112], "pos": [1869.5638427734375, 2057.363525390625], "widgets_values": ["", "去空行"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "input_string"}, "name": "input_string", "link": 101, "label": "input_string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "input_string"}, {"widget": {"name": "option"}, "name": "option", "label": "option", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "option"}], "flags": {}, "id": 46, "type": "ProcessString", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ProcessString"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [17, 105], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [218.14663696289062, 49.25611114501953], "pos": [3818.9306640625, 1342.543212890625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 57, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 66, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.60", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [1222.079345703125, 538.1791381835938], "pos": [4077.645751953125, 1301.1893310546875], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 105, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【输入方式】：参考图 + 文本描述  \n【延展目标】：基于上一张图的画面风格、人物外形、光影氛围、镜头语言，生成下一张分镜图，使得剧情延续\n提⽰词=主体（主体描述）+场景（场景描述）+运动（运动描述）+美学控制+风格化\n\n保持人物外观一致  \n色调光影与参考图统一  \n背景元素延续，不突变  \n构图具备电影感（景别/光影/空间层次）\n\n镜头类型（特写/中景/远景/俯拍/跟拍/环绕/侧移/拉远）  \n镜头运动节奏（慢推/快切/手持感）  \n\n人物发色、身形不变  \n服饰延续衔接，不跳变  \n动作表情是上一个镜头的自然推进  \n背景环境连续递进\n\n高清画面  \n电影级光影  \n真实材质  \n无噪点无畸变  \n可作为下一张分镜生成基础\n\n输出时以Next Scene:开头，后面马上接文字。每一段文字是连续的，没有特殊符号，没有多余的解释，每一段文字100字左右，直接输出内容。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "参考图出分镜交付格式-提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [668.01318359375, 388.39837646484375], "pos": [646.803955078125, 746.6753540039062], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["你需要学习这个文档内容，然后我会给你一张图片，你需要给我一个5秒的图生视频的提示词。\n\n提示词的公式是：视频提示词= 运动 + 运镜\n运动描述：结合图像中的元素（如⼈物、动物），描述其相动态的过程，如奔跑、打招呼，可以通\n过形容词来控制动态的程度与速度，如“快速地”、“缓慢地”。\n运镜：若对镜头运动有特定要求，通过提示词如“镜头推进”、“镜头左移”控制，若希望镜头不要发\n⽣变化，可以通过“固定镜头”来强调。\n同时也需要结合影视级没血控制，光源，光线，景别文档中的视频类型来创建。5秒的图生视频提示词需要给到2-3个镜头。按秒给，比如第1秒，第2-3秒。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "图生视频交付格式-提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [663.0411987304688, 178.59654235839844], "pos": [649.1685180664062, 1209.5419921875], "id": 55, "properties": {}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [1269.7308349609375, 1105.54736328125], "pos": [2700.265625, 1914.847900390625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 17, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.60", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [47], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [962.976318359375, 692.6244506835938], "pos": [1378.5638427734375, 1324.607177734375], "widgets_values": ["bab0fcaec7d26056a4b28289ca67f60cd4c177fac1f92c48455f76bb170bc2e3.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.60", "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [101], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [468.541015625, 331.94146728515625], "pos": [1389.4395751953125, 2059.706787109375], "widgets_values": ["Next Scene:主体为黑衣男子与白衣男子在竹林中激烈对剑，双剑相击迸发银光，黑衣人眼神凌厉，白衣人姿态飘逸，长发随风扬起。场景延续浓雾缭绕的翠绿竹林，阳光透过竹叶形成斑驳光影，地面湿滑有露水反光。运动为快切镜头，捕捉剑刃碰撞瞬间与动作轨迹，节奏紧凑。美学控制采用高对比度自然光与薄雾渲染，强化动态模糊与衣物飘动质感，风格化为经典武侠美学，构图采用中景对角线构图，突出对抗张力。\n\nNext Scene:主体为白衣男子腾空跃起，剑尖划出弧形气流，黑衣人低身闪避，竹枝被震断飞散。场景为竹林深处，雾气翻涌，背景竹影交错，光线从上方穿透形成光束。运动为环绕镜头，围绕两人旋转拍摄，展现空间立体感与战斗节奏。美学控制保持清新绿调与柔和逆光，强调剑气与尘埃漂浮效果，风格化为诗意武学意境，构图采用远景，突出环境与人物动态关系。\n\nNext Scene:主体为黑衣男子猛然劈剑，剑锋斩断数根竹子，竹片四溅，他面露狠绝之色。场景为竹林局部，断裂竹节倒地，地面落叶纷飞，雾气因动作搅动而流动。运动为慢推镜头，聚焦剑刃与竹节接触瞬间，增强冲击力。美学控制使用高速摄影质感，保留细节真实，如布料褶皱与汗水滴落，风格化为力量爆发式画面，构图采用近景特写，突出武器与面部表情。\n\nNext Scene:主体为白衣男子后退半步，手中长剑轻点地面，激起微尘，目光沉静如水。场景为竹林空地，周围竹影摇曳，雾气渐淡，远处隐约可见山峦轮廓。运动为侧移镜头，缓慢横向移动，跟随人物重心变化。美学控制维持清冷色调，增加地面反光与空气粒子感，风格化为内敛高手气质，构图采用中景偏低角度，营造压迫感与距离感。\n\nNext Scene:主体为一截断裂的竹枝斜插于泥土中，竹节上刻有一道细痕，旁边落叶覆盖着一丝血迹。场景为竹林地面，湿润土壤与残叶交织，晨雾未散，光线柔和。运动为静止特写，无镜头移动，聚焦细节纹理。美学控制采用微距摄影手法，展现材质真实感，如竹纹、水珠与血渍边缘，风格化为无声叙事，构图简洁，突出悲剧意味与时间凝固感。\n\nNext Scene:主体为白衣男子低头凝视手中剑柄，剑身沾染一点血迹，指尖轻抚其上，神情复杂。场景为竹林静谧角落，背景虚化，仅见几缕竹叶垂落。运动为极缓慢推近镜头，由手部逐渐移至面部，情绪递进。美学控制使用柔光与浅景深，强调眼神中的悲悯与挣扎，风格化为内心戏特写，构图采用特写，突出情感细节与物象象征意义。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1917.6733942634846, -341.07595840994844], "scale": 0.8769226950000115}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "模型加载", "bounding": [1367.2164306640625, 712.469970703125, 1062.8602294921875, 503.1004943847656]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "图片+提示词输入", "bounding": [1367.5447998046875, 1251.0072021484375, 1279.051513671875, 1160.5238037109375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "采样", "bounding": [2667.49365234375, 1254.907470703125, 1379.58349609375, 583.909912109375]}, {"color": "#A88", "font_size": 144, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "影视分镜批量生成-Qwen-Edit + next-scene", "bounding": [1368.0506591796875, 405.2100830078125, 2815.93701171875, 185.87937927246094]}], "links": [[17, 12, 0, 13, 0, "IMAGE"], [23, 15, 0, 7, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [47, 10, 0, 33, 0, "IMAGE"], [54, 38, 0, 7, 0, "MODEL"], [57, 7, 0, 12, 0, "LATENT"], [60, 33, 0, 34, 0, "IMAGE"], [66, 37, 0, 12, 1, "VAE"], [67, 36, 0, 42, 0, "CLIP"], [68, 37, 0, 42, 1, "VAE"], [69, 35, 0, 42, 2, "IMAGE"], [70, 40, 0, 42, 8, "STRING"], [71, 42, 0, 7, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [72, 42, 0, 15, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [73, 42, 1, 7, 3, "LATENT"], [75, 4, 0, 44, 0, "MODEL"], [76, 44, 0, 28, 0, "MODEL"], [93, 43, 1, 26, 0, "CLIP"], [94, 43, 2, 27, 0, "VAE"], [95, 43, 0, 4, 0, "MODEL"], [101, 51, 0, 46, 0, "STRING"], [102, 46, 0, 16, 0, "STRING"], [103, 16, 0, 39, 0, "STRING"], [104, 46, 0, 48, 0, "*"], [105, 12, 0, 53, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "5c25acfe-0f63-4a34-a0c6-138e1d8a102e", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 55, "revision": 0}